        // Step 1: SetLogFile before initialization (works on both, because initialized false — reference: if(initialized) revert() -> false, proceeds; mutant: if(!initialized) revert() -> true, revert? NO: !initialized is true when initialized false, so mutant reverts! So even the first call fails on mutant. So we need a different approach.
